			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { type SidebarNavGroup } from \"./app-shared.ts\";\n\timport * as Collapsible from \"#lib/components/ui/collapsible/index.js\";\n\timport * as Sidebar from \"#lib/components/ui/sidebar/index.js\";\n\timport { ChevronRightIcon } from \"@lucide/svelte\";\n\n\tlet { label, items }: SidebarNavGroup = $props();\n</script>\n\n<Sidebar.Group>\n\t{#if label}\n\t\t<Sidebar.GroupLabel>{label}</Sidebar.GroupLabel>\n\t{/if}\n\t<Sidebar.Menu>\n\t\t{#each items as item (item.title)}\n\t\t\t{@const Icon = item.icon}\n\t\t\t<Collapsible.Root\n\t\t\t\topen={!!item.isActive || item.subItems?.some((i) => !!i.isActive)}\n\t\t\t\tclass=\"group/collapsible\"\n\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t{#snippet child({ props })}\n\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuItem {...props}>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{#if item.subItems?.length}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Collapsible.Trigger>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{#snippet child({ props })}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuButton {...props} tooltipContent={item.title}>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{#if item.icon}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<item.icon />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{/if}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>{item.title}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ChevronRightIcon\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"ms-auto transition-transform duration-200 group-data-[state=open]/collapsible:rotate-90\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{/snippet}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Collapsible.Trigger>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Collapsible.Content>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuSub>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{#each item.subItems as subItem (subItem.title)}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuSubItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuSubButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{#snippet child({ props })}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href={subItem.path} {...props}>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>{subItem.title}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{/snippet}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuSubButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuSubItem>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{/each}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuSub>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Collapsible.Content>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{:else}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Sidebar.MenuButton isActive={item.isActive}>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{#snippet child({ props })}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a {...props} href={item.path}>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Icon />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>{item.title}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{/snippet}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuButton>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{/if}\n\t\t\t\t\t</Sidebar.MenuItem>\n\t\t\t\t{/snippet}\n\t\t\t</Collapsible.Root>\n\t\t{/each}\n\t</Sidebar.Menu>\n</Sidebar.Group>\n",
